1. Problem Statement

You are given an array prices.

prices[i] represents the stock price on the i-th day.

You can buy only once.

You can sell only once.

You must buy before selling.

Return the maximum profit.

If no profit is possible, return 0.

Example

prices = [7,1,5,3,6,4]

Buy at price = 1

Sell at price = 6

Profit = 6 - 1 = 5

Output

5
