6. Algorithm

Take first price as minimum.

Take answer = 0.

Traverse array.

If current price is smaller

Update minimum.

Else

Calculate

currentPrice - minimum

Update answer.

Return answer.
------------------------------------------------------------------------
7. Pseudocode

minimum = prices[0]

profit = 0

for every price

    if price < minimum

        minimum = price

    else

        profit = max(profit, price-minimum)

return profit
